<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Wedding Invitation</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

  <h2>🌙 بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْم 🌙</h2>

  <p>✨ السَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ ✨</p>

  <p>🤍 بَارَكَ اللّٰهُ لَكُمَا وَبَارَكَ عَلَيْكُمَا وَجَمَعَ بَيْنَكُمَا فِي خَيْرٍ 🤍</p>

  <h1>Mohamed Anas ❤️ Moshina Yasmin</h1>

  <p>Two beautiful souls united by Allah 💍</p>

  <h2>Countdown to Nikah</h2>

  <div id="timer"></div>

  <p>📅 06 September 2026 (Sunday)</p>
  <p>🕌 12:15 PM</p>
  <p>📍 Jamia Zainul Uloom, Thanjavur</p>

  <p>Your presence, blessings & duas mean a lot to us 🤲</p>

  <button>📄 Download Invitation PDF</button>

  <p>✨ JazakAllahu Khair ✨</p>

</div>

<script>
  var wedding = new Date("September 6, 2026 12:15:00").getTime();

  setInterval(function () {
    var now = new Date().getTime();
    var diff = wedding - now;

    var d = Math.floor(diff / (1000*60*60*24));
    var h = Math.floor((diff / (1000*60*60)) % 24);
    var m = Math.floor((diff / (1000*60)) % 60);
    var s = Math.floor((diff / 1000) % 60);

    document.getElementById("timer").innerHTML =
      d + "d " + h + "h " + m + "m " + s + "s";
  }, 1000);
</script>

</body>
</html>
